---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy ｜ PubMed Trivia"
  description="How PubMed Trivia handles cookies, ad personalization, analytics, and affiliate links."
  lang="en"
>
  <article>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

    <p>
      This policy explains how PubMed Trivia ("the site") handles information about its visitors.
      We may update this policy without prior notice; please review it periodically.
    </p>

    <h2>1. Information we collect</h2>
    <p>
      The site does not offer user accounts and does not directly collect personal information from
      visitors. However, third-party advertising and analytics services described below may collect
      browser-level data such as access timestamps, referrer URLs, browser type, IP address, and cookie identifiers.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      The site and its third-party ad providers may set cookies in your browser. You can delete or
      disable cookies in your browser settings. Disabling cookies may impair certain features or ad personalization.
    </p>

    <h2>3. Third-party advertising</h2>
    <p>
      We plan to display ads via Google AdSense. Google may use cookies to personalize ads based on
      your interests. For details on opting out, see
      <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Google's policies on advertising</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Affiliate program</h2>
    <p>
      The site is a participant in the Amazon Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program
      designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by linking to Amazon.com and
      affiliates. Purchases through our links may result in a commission to us. Pricing is not affected.
    </p>
    <p>
      Articles containing affiliate links are clearly labeled with <code>#PR</code>.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      We may use Google Analytics, which uses cookies to collect anonymized traffic data. See
      <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Google's Privacy Policy</a>
      for details.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Disclaimer</h2>
    <p>
      Content on the site is general-interest trivia based on academic research and is not medical
      advice. We are not responsible for content on external sites linked from ours.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Copyright</h2>
    <p>
      Article copyright belongs to the operator of this site. Unauthorized reproduction beyond fair
      use is prohibited. Original paper titles, PMIDs, and source URLs are displayed in respect of authors' rights.
    </p>

    <h2>8. Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about this policy or the site can be sent to
      <a href="mailto:sciencepubmedjp@gmail.com">sciencepubmedjp@gmail.com</a>.
    </p>

    <hr />
    <p><small>Effective: 2026-05-14</small></p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
